## Common Phase 10 Issues & Resolutions

| Issue | Resolution |
|-------|------------|
| Agent not detected | Provide 10+ code samples for detection, use generic adapter fallback |
| Hook files not loading | Verify `.claude/skills/` directory path, re-install DraCo if needed |
| YAGNI ladder too strict | Adjust level: `--yonagi-level 4` or `--yonagi-level 5` for your workflow |
| Seamless integration causes disruption | Check version compatibility: `draco version --check --matrix` |
| MCP routing conflicts between agents | Use `--conflict-resolution --auto` or per-agent MCP configs |
| Profile import/export failures | Check YAML syntax, verify profile version compatibility |
| Agent detection accuracy low | Provide more samples (10+), check code style patterns |

## Skill Execution

### Command Line
```bash
# Initialize DraCo with Phase 10 Agent Integration
draco init --phase 10

# Detect agent type
draco detect --agent --input ./my_code.py

# Set agent profile
draco profile --set --agent claude_code --optimization-level maximum \
  --yonagi-ladder-level 3

# Generate integration hook
draco integrate --agent claude_code --full

# Test YAGNI enforcement
draco yagni --enforce --ladder-level 3

# View agent profiles
draco profile --list

# Check compatibility
draco version --check --matrix

# Enable seamless integration
draco integrate --seamless --no-disruption
```

### Skill File Integration
This skill file is auto-loaded by DraCo at session start and integrates with:
- `.claude/skills/draco-baseline.skill` (Phase 1 - baseline for agent detection)
- `.claude/skills/draco-mcp-integration.skill` (Phase 2 - agent-aware MCP routing)
- `.claude/skills/draco-tree-sitter.skill` (Phase 3 - agent-specific skeleton extraction)
- `.claude/skills/draco-hybrid-rag.skill` (Phase 4 - agent-specific RAG configuration)
- `.claude/skills/draco-yaml-filters.skill` (Phase 5 - agent-specific YAML filters)
- `.claude/skills/draco-noise-cancellation.skill` (Phase 6 - agent-specific noise profiles)
- `.claude/skills/draco-verdict-first.skill` (Phase 7 - agent-specific verdict formatting)
- `.claude/skills/draco-zon-format.skill` (Phase 8 - agent-specific format settings)
- `.claude/skills/draco-quantization.skill` (Phase 9 - agent-specific pruning/quantization)
- `.claude/skills/draco-deployment.skill` (Phase 12 - agent deployment configurations)

### Dependencies
- Requires: `draco-core >= 1.0`, `draco-nlp >= 1.0`, `draco-ml >= 1.0`
- Requires: `agent-profile-configs >= 1.0` (100+ profiles included)
- Optional: `mlflow >= 2.5.0` (for experiment tracking)
- Compatible with: All 50+ DraCo agent integrations

